window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Long awaited . . .</p> <p>Two sets of siblings. One father. Now meet.</p> <p>A father's dream to completely recompense for his wrongs and love all his children together is granted to him. Will it be drama, or will it be all love? Maybe it'll be both.</p> <p>Listener's note: Before listening to We Are One, listeners should have listened to the Soulmates series and the Enigma series books because We Are One is a union and reunion of both series.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
